1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,526
Now soak a dry pea overnight.

2
00:00:02,526 --> 00:00:05,846
By morning it is two or three times its size.

3
00:00:05,846 --> 00:00:15,416
This is imbibition: water is adsorbed by hydrophilic colloids such as protein, starch and cellulose, and they swell as they take it up.

4
00:00:15,416 --> 00:00:18,020
It is the very first step of germination.

